# Exclusions for the Jess Docker build context. Keep the BuildKit
# transfer + Go COPY phase fast and reproducible. The frontend stage
# (FROM node:22-bookworm) declares its OWN explicit COPY paths under
# cmd/jess-web/web/ — none of these matter for it. The Go stage's
# `COPY . .` is what the rules below tame.

# Already produced by the in-image frontend stage; the Go stage's
# `COPY --from=frontend /web/dist` overwrites it anyway. Keep it out
# of the COPY . . transfer so a stale local dist/ never substitutes
# for the freshly-built one.
cmd/jess-web/web/dist/*
!cmd/jess-web/web/dist/.gitkeep
cmd/jess-web/web/node_modules/
cmd/jess-web/web/*.tsbuildinfo
cmd/jess-web/web/.vite/

# Tests + tooling not needed for the image
**/*_test.go
**/testdata/

# Editor / OS / local notes
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
*.local
*.local.*

# VCS / CI metadata
.git/
.gitlab-ci.yml
.gitignore

# Rust (Phase 5f scaffold; not in the Go-only image yet)
rust/**/target/
# The root Dockerfile's session_live stage builds from
# services/ironrdp-broker/crates source; the cargo target/ tree is
# stage-internal and large — keep it out of the BuildKit context transfer.
services/ironrdp-broker/target/

# Misc
**/*.md
README*
docs/
